# OS cruft
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db

# Editor
*~
*.swp

# Inbox contents stay untracked until triaged and filed. Unfiled documents are
# transient, and some carry personal or financial detail that shouldn't enter
# git history before anyone has looked at it. See _inbox/README.md.
_inbox/*
!_inbox/README.md
!_inbox/.gitkeep
